Drupal 11 compatibility for field_states_ui 3.0.0 (core_version_requirement only).
Same info.yml change as https://git.drupalcode.org/project/field_states_ui/-/merge_requests/12
(https://www.drupal.org/project/field_states_ui/issues/3430531). Upstream moved
D11 support to the untagged 4.x branch (^11.2); there is no 3.x D11 release.

diff --git a/field_states_ui.info.yml b/field_states_ui.info.yml
--- a/field_states_ui.info.yml
+++ b/field_states_ui.info.yml
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
